# L §3.3 factor: "a non-integer n needs to u (§7.3)": (1.01)^(1/2) without to is refused LOAD-TO.
=== m.tally
model t
  tally 2
  on 2026-12-31
  start 2026-01-01
  end 2026-12-31

source s "s"
unit PLN: currency minor 0.01

input r: rate
input c12: compounding
input half: num
def f: num = factor(r, half, month, c12) at reader

version v
  cite s
  governs 2026..
  known 2026-01-01
  r = 12 %/year
  c12 = nominal 12
  half = 0.5

ask a: f law 2026-06-30
=== expect
refused: LOAD-TO ...
